    <bpmn:process id="W_W129" name="W129. Private Label / In-house Brand Development" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Category strategy (white space identification) or high-volume item with margin expansion potential
Frequency: Periodic; 10–20 new products per year
Volume: Managing ~5–10 in-house brands
Owner: Private Label Manager
Participants: Category Manager, Quality Assurance (QA), Legal (IP), Sourcing
Source: workflow W129 — Private Label / In-house Brand Development</bpmn:documentation>
