    <bpmn:process id="W_W624" name="W624. Competitor Store Visit Program &amp; Market Intelligence Operations" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly calendar; new competitor store opening; seasonal intelligence refresh
Frequency: Monthly structured visits; continuous ad-hoc intelligence gathering
Volume: ~20–30 store visits/month across top competitor chains in Philippines
Owner: Category Manager
Participants: Category Manager, Buyers, Store Operations team members, Merchandising Analyst
Source: workflow W624 — Competitor Store Visit Program &amp; Market Intelligence Operations</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W624_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W624_Lane1" name="Merchandising Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W624_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W624_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W624_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W624_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W624_Lane2" name="Visit Team">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W624_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W624_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W624_Lane3" name="Category Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W624_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W624_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W624_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W624_Start5" name="Monthly calendar; new competitor store opening; seasonal intelligence refresh">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W624_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W624_Task6" name="Merchandising Analyst prepares monthly competitor visit schedule based on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Merchandising Analyst prepares monthly competitor visit schedule based on competitive landscape: prioritizes (a) competitor new store openings, (b) competitor promotional periods, (c) seasonal events, (d) stores in same trade area as underperforming BuildRight stores
Responsible (R): Merchandising Analyst
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W624_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W624_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W624_Task7" name="Visit team conducts structured competitor store visit using mobile assessment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Visit team conducts structured competitor store visit using mobile assessment form: (a) pricing survey (top 100 comparable SKUs), (b) assortment breadth assessment, (c) promotional activity documentation (signage, discounts, bundling), (d) store layout and merchandising observation, (e) customer traffic observation, (f) service quality assessment, (g) new product identification
Responsible (R): Visit Team
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 2 hours/visit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W624_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W624_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W624_Task8" name="Visit team captures competitive price data using barcode scanning app: scans…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Visit team captures competitive price data using barcode scanning app: scans competitor shelf labels for exact price comparison against BuildRight&#x27;s prices on same/comparable SKUs; system auto-calculates price gap percentage by category
Responsible (R): Visit Team
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min/visit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W624_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W624_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W624_Task9" name="Merchandising Analyst uploads visit data to competitor intelligence master (per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Merchandising Analyst uploads visit data to competitor intelligence master (per W403); system auto-populates price comparison dashboard, assortment gap analysis, and promotional activity timeline
Responsible (R): Merchandising Analyst
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W624_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W624_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W624_Task10" name="Category Manager reviews competitive intelligence dashboard weekly: (a) price…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Category Manager reviews competitive intelligence dashboard weekly: (a) price position by category (BuildRight vs. competitor average), (b) promotional frequency and depth comparison, (c) assortment gaps (competitor carries items BuildRight doesn&#x27;t), (d) new product launches by competitors
Responsible (R): Category Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W624_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W624_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W624_Task11" name="Monthly: Category Manager presents competitive intelligence summary to VP…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Monthly: Category Manager presents competitive intelligence summary to VP Merchandising — key findings, competitive threats, pricing opportunities, and recommended actions (price adjustments per W40, assortment additions per W564, promotional response per W329)
Responsible (R): Category Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 1 hour</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W624_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W624_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W624_Task12" name="Quarterly: Merchandising Analyst produces comprehensive competitive landscape…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Quarterly: Merchandising Analyst produces comprehensive competitive landscape report: market share estimates, pricing trend analysis, competitor expansion plans, and strategic implications for BuildRight&#x27;s assortment and pricing strategy
Responsible (R): Merchandising Analyst
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 8 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W624_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W624_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W624_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W624_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W624_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-240 (ensure controlled execution — Assortment Planning &amp; Product Lifecycle (PA-01.1).) | - operational: rotating visit teams and using diverse shopper profiles; operational: barcode scanning where possible and data validation rules; operational: comparable SKU mapping and per-unit-price normalization
Owner: Category Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
