    <bpmn:process id="W_W830" name="W830. Product Phase-Out Inventory Disposition Planning &amp; Execution" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Product lifecycle status changed to &quot;End of Life&quot; or &quot;Discontinued&quot; per W315 lifecycle status transition
Frequency: Monthly; ~100–200 SKUs enter phase-out per month
Volume: ~100–200 SKUs/month; total phase-out inventory value ~PHP 15-30M/month (at cost)
Owner: Merchandise Planner
Participants: Merchandise Planner, Category Manager, Procurement Analyst, Finance Analyst, Store Operations Manager
Source: workflow W830 — Product Phase-Out Inventory Disposition Planning &amp; Execution</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W830_LaneSet6">
        <bpmn:lane id="W830_Lane1" name="Category Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W830_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W830_Start7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W830_Lane2" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W830_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W830_Task16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W830_Lane3" name="Merchandise Planner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W830_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W830_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W830_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W830_Task15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W830_Task17</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W830_Task18</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W830_Lane4" name="Finance Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W830_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W830_Lane5" name="Procurement Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W830_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W830_End19</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W830_Start7" name="Product lifecycle status changed to &quot;End of Life&quot; or &quot;Discontinued&quot; per W315 lifecycle…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W830_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W830_Task8" name="Phase-out initiation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Phase-out initiation: Category Manager initiates phase-out per W68: changes lifecycle status to &quot;End of Life&quot; per W315
Responsible (R): Category Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 15-30 min per SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W830_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W830_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W830_Task9" name="Phase-out inventory report generation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Phase-out inventory report generation: system generates report: (a) on-hand quantity by location (200 stores + 4 DCs); (b) on-order quantity (open POs per W2); (c) in-transit quantity per INV-014; (d) current WAC value per INV-003; (e) recent sell-through rate; (f) pending returns/VMI stock per W20
Responsible (R): System / Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 10-15 min per SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W830_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W830_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W830_Task10" name="Disposition plan creation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Disposition plan creation: Merchandise Planner creates disposition plan: (a) cancel open purchase orders per W2 for phased-out SKU; (b) halt replenishment — system updates W312 planning parameters to zero; (c) set markdown schedule — progressive discounts: Week 1-2: 20% off, Week 3-4: 40% off, Week 5-6: 60% off, Week 7+: 80% off or bundling; (d) vendor return eligibility check — review W62 vendor contract for return provisions; (e) estimate disposition value and write-off per option
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 30-60 min per SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W830_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W830_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W830_Task11" name="Finance review of disposition plan">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Finance review of disposition plan: Finance Analyst reviews: (a) projected recovery value vs. book value; (b) inventory write-down accrual per W636 balance sheet reconciliation; (c) margin impact on category P&amp;L per W102 category performance
Responsible (R): Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 15-30 min per SKU batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W830_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W830_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W830_Task12" name="Disposition execution — markdown sell-through">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Disposition execution — markdown sell-through: system applies markdown schedule per W93; stores execute per W532 clearance processing; track sell-through rate weekly
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner / Store Ops Manager
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 15 min/week per SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W830_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W830_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W830_Task13" name="Disposition execution — vendor return">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Disposition execution — vendor return: Procurement Analyst coordinates with vendor per W88 RTV; vendor credit note applied per W7
Responsible (R): Procurement Analyst
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 1-2 hours per vendor batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W830_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W830_Flow28</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W830_Task14" name="Disposition execution — clearance channel transfer">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Disposition execution — clearance channel transfer: if available, move to designated clearance area or marketplace per W180
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 30 min per SKU batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W830_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W830_Flow29</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W830_Task15" name="Disposition execution — donation or scrap">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Disposition execution — donation or scrap: remaining unsold items to community per W444 community donation; final disposition per W443 salvage; system writes off inventory per W92
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner / Store Ops Manager
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 30-60 min per SKU batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W830_Flow29</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W830_Flow30</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W830_Task16" name="Transaction blocking and assortment update">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: Transaction blocking and assortment update: system blocks: (a) no new POs; (b) no replenishment orders; (c) no inter-store transfers in; (d) markdown pricing active per schedule; (e) item removed from assortment matrix per W299
Responsible (R): System / Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W830_Flow30</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W830_Flow31</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W830_Task17" name="Disposition close-out">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 10: Disposition close-out: when all inventory dispositioned: (a) system sets lifecycle status to &quot;Discontinued&quot; per W315; (b) final financial reconciliation per W9A month-end; (c) Category Manager documents lessons learned; (d) update planogram per W314 to replace with new product
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner / Category Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 15-30 min per SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W830_Flow31</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W830_Flow32</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W830_Task18" name="Monthly disposition analytics">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 11: Monthly disposition analytics: (a) recovery rate by disposition method; (b) average time to full disposition; (c) write-off rate as % of original value; (d) disposition cost (markdown loss, return freight, scrap processing)
Responsible (R): Merchandise Planner
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 2-3 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W830_Flow32</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W830_Flow33</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W830_End19" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W830_Flow33</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W830_Annotation20">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-240 (ensure controlled execution — Assortment Planning &amp; Product Lifecycle (PA-01.1).) | - operational: Merchandise Planner review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Merchandise Planner</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W830_Assoc21" sourceRef="W830_Annotation20" targetRef="W830_Start7" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W830_Flow22" sourceRef="W830_Start7" targetRef="W830_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W830_Flow23" sourceRef="W830_Task8" targetRef="W830_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W830_Flow24" sourceRef="W830_Task9" targetRef="W830_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W830_Flow25" sourceRef="W830_Task10" targetRef="W830_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W830_Flow26" sourceRef="W830_Task11" targetRef="W830_Task12" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W830_Flow27" sourceRef="W830_Task12" targetRef="W830_Task13" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W830_Flow28" sourceRef="W830_Task13" targetRef="W830_Task14" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W830_Flow29" sourceRef="W830_Task14" targetRef="W830_Task15" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W830_Flow30" sourceRef="W830_Task15" targetRef="W830_Task16" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W830_Flow31" sourceRef="W830_Task16" targetRef="W830_Task17" />
