    <bpmn:process id="W_W1547" name="W1547. Product Regulatory Compliance Certification Management (DTI-BPS, FPA, DENR) &amp; Renewal Tracking" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New product introduction requiring certification; or upcoming certification renewal (30/60/90-day alert)
Frequency: Ongoing (~200–300 new SKUs/quarter require certification check; ~50–100 renewals/year)
Volume: Critical for chemical/paint (FPA), electrical (DTI-BPS), lumber/building materials (DENR)
Owner: Regulatory Compliance Officer
Participants: Regulatory Officer, Category Manager, Buyer, Quality Assurance, Legal Counsel
Source: workflow W1547 — Product Regulatory Compliance Certification Management (DTI-BPS, FPA, DENR) &amp; Renewal Tracking</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1547_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1547_Lane1" name="Regulatory Officer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1547_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1547_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1547_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1547_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1547_Lane2" name="Buyer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1547_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1547_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1547_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1547_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1547_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1547_Start5" name="New product introduction requiring certification; or upcoming certification renewal…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1547_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1547_Task6" name="New product certification assessment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: New product certification assessment: For each new SKU in a regulated category (electrical, paint/chemical, cement, construction materials), Regulatory Officer checks product against DTI-BPS mandatory certification list, FPA regulated product list, and DENR environmental clearance requirements; determines applicable certifications
Responsible (R): Regulatory Officer
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 20 min/SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1547_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1547_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1547_Task7" name="Vendor certification documentation collection">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Vendor certification documentation collection: Buyer requests product test reports, certificates of conformity, PS/ICC marks from vendor; for imports, verifies that Philippine certifications are obtained or in process
Responsible (R): Buyer
Accountable (A): Regulatory Officer
Duration: 1–3 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1547_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1547_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1547_Task8" name="System certification tag">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System certification tag: Upon verification, Regulatory Officer tags SKU in item master with certification type (PS Mark, ICC, FPA registration, DENR clearance), certification number, issuing authority, valid-from date, expiry date; system blocks sale of SKU in regulated category without valid certification tag
Responsible (R): Regulatory Officer
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 10 min/SKU</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1547_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1547_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1547_Task9" name="Renewal monitoring">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Renewal monitoring: System generates automated alerts at 90 days, 60 days, and 30 days before certification expiry; Regulatory Officer tracks renewal applications with issuing agency
Responsible (R): System / Regulatory Officer
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 15 min/renewal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1547_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1547_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1547_Task10" name="Expired certification handling">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Expired certification handling: If certification expires without renewal, system automatically blocks the SKU from sale at POS and ecommerce; flags inventory as &quot;Certification Pending&quot;; Regulatory Officer coordinates with vendor for urgent renewal or product withdrawal
Responsible (R): System / Regulatory Officer
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 30 min/event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1547_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1547_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1547_Task11" name="Quarterly compliance audit">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Quarterly compliance audit: Regulatory Officer runs compliance report across all 35,000 active SKUs; identifies any SKUs in regulated categories missing certification tags; escalates to Category Manager for resolution; reports compliance rate to VP Legal
Responsible (R): Regulatory Officer
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: 4 hours/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1547_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1547_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1547_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1547_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1547_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-240 (ensure controlled execution — Assortment Planning &amp; Product Lifecycle (PA-01.1).) | - operational: certification list, requiring retroactive compliance checks on existing SKUs
Owner: Regulatory Compliance Officer</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
